* the honourable and '''learned''' member, {{q|UK}} a fellow [[Member of Parliament]] who is a lawyer
* the '''learned''' judge (e.g. ''the learned trial judge'', ''the learned appeal court justice''), the judge of the court below
}}
{{en-adj}}
