=====Usage notes=====
* This adjectival sense of this word is sometimes spelled with a [[grave accent]], {{m|en|learnèd}}. This is meant to indicate that the second ‘e’ is pronounced as {{IPAchar|/ɪ/}} or {{IPAchar|/ə/}}, rather than being silent, as in the verb form. This spelling is largely restricted to poetry and other works in which it is important that the adjective’s [[disyllabicity]] be made explicit.

